spice
* SPICE Netlist
M1 2 5 2 2 NMOS ; M1: Source=2, Gate=5, Drain=2
M2 2 6 2 2 NMOS ; M2: Source=2, Gate=6, Drain=2
M3 4 5 33 33 PMOS ; M3: Source=33, Gate=5, Drain=4
M4 33 6 4 4 PMOS ; M4: Source=4, Gate=6, Drain=33
VDD 4 0 DC VDD ; Voltage source VDD connected to net 4 and 0
? Missing component
IISS 2 0 DC IISS ; Current source IISS between net 2 and ground
RD1 5 4 RD ; Resistor RD connected from net 5 to VDD
RD2 6 33 RD ; Resistor RD connected from net 6 to VDD
CL1 2 0 CL ; Capacitor CL connected from net 2 to ground
CL2 3 0 CL ; Capacitor CL connected from net 3 to ground
CB 5 6 CB ; Capacitor CB connected between net 5 and net 6
